{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":0,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"Irene Pepperberg, a researcher at Northwestern University, is discovering that a parrot can not only mimic people but also learn the meaning of words.","ja":"ノースウエスタン大学の研究者、アイリーン・ペパーバーグは、オウムは人の口まねをするだけでなく言葉の意味を学ぶことができることを発見しつつある。","ref":"35781_198588","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Jack keeps a cat and a parrot at home.","ja":"ジャックは家で猫とオウムを飼っている。","ref":"53129_215828","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"But Pepperberg says working with the parrot has already changed the way of looking at animals.","ja":"しかしペパーバーグは、そのオウムを研究することによって、動物に対する考え方が変わったといっている。","ref":"53552_216248","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Parrots imitate human speech.","ja":"オウムは人間の言葉をまねる。","ref":"65169_227816","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"A parrot can mimic a person's voice.","ja":"オウムは人の声を真似ることができる。","ref":"65170_227817","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["鸚鵡"],"glosses":["(large) parrot (incl. the cockatoo)"],"id":"1575140","lemma":"鸚鵡","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"オウム","readings":["オウム","おうむ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/鸚鵡#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/鸚/鸚鵡/鸚鵡.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["葵花鸚鵡，鳳頭鸚鵡"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["葵花鸚鵡，鳳頭鸚鵡"],"pos":"n"}]},{"common":false,"etymology":["源自鸚鵡 (ōmu) + 貝 (kai)。對照漢語 鸚鵡螺／鹦鹉螺 (yīngwǔluó)、朝鮮語 앵무조개 (aengmujogae)、越南語 ốc anh vũ。"],"examples":[],"forms":["鸚鵡貝"],"glosses":["chambered nautilus (esp. species Nautilus pompilius)"],"id":"1575150","lemma":"鸚鵡貝","pos":["n"],"readings":["おうむがい","オウムガイ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/鸚鵡貝#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/鸚/鸚鵡/鸚鵡貝.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["鸚鵡螺"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["鸚鵡螺"],"pos":"n"}]},{"accent":1,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"Let's get what we need to keep a parrot.","ja":"インコを飼うために必要なものを揃えましょう。","ref":"329437_74283","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"In o